<title>UK: Schroders set calls on a basket of French stocks.</title>
<headline>Schroders set calls on a basket of French stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>J. Henry Shroder &amp; Co. Ltd said it has issued 375,000 European-style call warrants, on a basket of French property stocks.</p>
<p>The basket includes shares of Bail Investissement, GFC, Immeubles de France, Klepierre, Sefimeg, Silic, Simco and Unibail.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    200 FRF		   ISSUE PRICE  25.70 FRF</p>
<p> MATURITY	  TWO YEARS		 LISTING	PARIS</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>Schroder France SA and Dupont Denant SA are co-arrangers.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
